[resource]
script = ExtResource("3_byjpg")
icon = ExtResource("2_pky3j")
label = "Heightmap"
tooltip = "Heightmap Tool

Used to export and import heightmap data from and (on)to the terrain.

[INFO]
• EXPORT MODE: Exports terrain data as greyscale PNG's (heightmap, grass mask, texture index).
• IMPORT MODE: Imports greyscale PNG's as data for the creation of terrain chunks.
• LIBRARY MODE: Can create heightmaps from 3D meshes and then place them onto the terrain.
    • Handy for quickly terraforming the terrain in complex ways.

[SHORTCUTS]
• Shift+R: Rotate the current heightmap 90 degrees clockwise."
attributes = SubResource("Resource_he")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://brkjbcthwswel"
